    "title": "Gateway beats Paulsboro for third straight win - Girls soccer recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Cosentino ,\n57 minutes ago Penelope Floyd scored two goals and set up another as Gateway defeated Paulsboro 7-0 in Woodbury Heights. Kayleigh Daley and Maggie Magill each added a goal and an assist as the Gators (3-1) extended their winning streak to three. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
